  // The assistant books one itself now, inside save_caller, so the model has no
  // discretion left to get wrong. These strings are for the calls it still
  // could not book: a hang-up before a name, no opening hours on file, a slot
  // taken between the offer and the write. Every refusal names ITS OWN cause,
  // because one generic "couldn't do that" is what makes somebody press the
  // button a second time and get the same nothing.
