  // ── The in-place top-up dialog (app/components/ai/AiCreditTopupDialog.js) ──
  //
  // Opened over whatever was refused, so every sentence has to stand alone —
  // the person reading it is not on a billing page and did not come here to
  // think about payments. `stripeNote` is the one that earns its length: it is
  // the honest answer to "why can't it just use my subscription card", and the
  // alternative to saying it is a confirm button that fails SCA.
  //
  // `buyCredit` rather than the obvious `addCredit`: scripts/check-credit-
  // currency.mjs greps app/ and lib/ for the bare word "addCredit" to prove
  // only four modules may put money into the ledger, and a key by that name
  // in a component would join that list as a false positive. Its own comment
  // already names two files excluded for exactly this reason; a third
  // exception is worse than a different word.
