  "app.setVoice.tune.title": "How it sounds",
  "app.setVoice.tune.hint": "The defaults suit most people. Change these if your callers keep getting cut off, or if it keeps talking over them.",
  "app.setVoice.tune.unchanged": "None of these change what it's allowed to say. It still never gives a price, never promises a time it hasn't checked, and never claims to be a person.",
